Valid sequences are like palindromes—their ends are mirroring: each character or pair of characters will be mirrored, from left to right, and then to the right or left. Then, I can use dynammic programming to track the maximum length of valid string up to given index. Once that’s done, it’s simple to calculate all valid paths. Finally, scan all those paths (starting with an empty path) to find the best one.
