Each permutation has a weight. Weights (lengths of all pairs of soldiers connected by wire) do not add up to the length of wire, so it’s a loss. So it’s a maximization problem. Find the optimal set of permutations. No helper classes, no extra variables, just elegance and efficiency—no need for a jamboree.
